	(text "J2: EXC1 (outer excitation), SIN1, SIN2.  J3: COS1, COS2, EXC2.\nEvery second pin pair is GND to separate the coil pairs.\nLAYOUT: J2/J3 on the TOP side, at the same X/Y as the stator headers\n(stacked on M3 standoffs). Keep each P/N pair together to the AFE."
